{"node_id": "real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021_13_HY_001", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0003"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0003_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "I came to that decision recently when I started\nthinking about pregnancy and starting a family.\nThat is when epilepsy came back into my life as\na challenge. I knew it could impact my ability to\nget pregnant and have a healthy pregnancy. My\ndoctor said that if I got pregnant without being on\nmedicine, I could have a seizure and quickly lose\nthe baby. I decided that I needed to share this big\nstruggle I was going through. I came to realize that\ntelling my story would make me stronger and could\nhelp others.", "semantic_text": "I came to that decision recently when I started thinking about pregnancy and starting a family. That is when epilepsy came back into my life as a challenge. I knew it could impact my ability to get pregnant and have a healthy pregnancy. My doctor said that if I got pregnant without being on medicine, I could have a seizure and quickly lose the baby. I decided that I needed to share this big struggle I was going through. I came to realize that telling my story would make me stronger and could help others.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0003_geometry", "bbox": [157, 287, 596, 562], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0003"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_73/hybrid/real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021/page_0013/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021_13_HY_002", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0004"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0004_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Going public was very scary. Only my family and\nclosest friends knew about my epilepsy. There is\nstill a huge stigma and lack of understanding about\nthe condition. But it is the best thing I have ever\ndone. I received so many messages from women\nwho had epilepsy and had successful pregnancies\nwhile on their medicine. That gave me hope and\nstrength. By sharing, I was able to help others. So\nmany of my social media followers shared their own\nstories about living with epilepsy.", "semantic_text": "Going public was very scary. Only my family and closest friends knew about my epilepsy. There is still a huge stigma and lack of understanding about the condition. But it is the best thing I have ever done. I received so many messages from women who had epilepsy and had successful pregnancies while on their medicine. That gave me hope and strength. By sharing, I was able to help others. So many of my social media followers shared their own stories about living with epilepsy.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0004_geometry", "bbox": [157, 562, 603, 813], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0004"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_73/hybrid/real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021/page_0013/decisions.json"}
